              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakusacisamalila cenene citela ca mkuju, tacilya yisogosi yakwe, myoyo peyo soni mundu jwakusiŵalolela cenene ambujegwe tacipocela ucimbicimbi.",
          "type": "text",
